WEBVTT

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.000
Who are you?

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:14.930
Who, me?

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.500
Let me think...

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.610
I am time.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:36.330
Time that has been building up like sediment since days long past...

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:39.390
...in this world that is like the bottom of a valley.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.690
That is me.

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:01.390
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:07.120
...the instant I look away.

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:12.260
I just kept counting...

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:17.700
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:25.070
...that I'd vomited up.

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:31.010
In this time that seems so dry,

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:36.120
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:41.980
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.030
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:54.700
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:02.530
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.390
It's the emblem of a Witch, all right.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.930
You know what it is?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.900
The Salem Witch trials... You've heard of them, I assume?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:32.240
As I recall, that's where many women were put to death...

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.870
...in the eastern United States after being accused of witchcraft, right?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.970
That happened almost 400 years ago, right?

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:40.870
It happened in the 17th Century.

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:46.610
This emblem was carved into their bodies to mark them as Witches.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:53.290
Whatever it is, somebody's been sending it into the office computer since late last night.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:57.200
We started looking into it, and found it was coming from Robin's terminal.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.230
Robin's?

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:03.260
Yes. Michael is doing a detailed examination right now,

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.400
...but for now, there doesn't seem to be any real damage to the system.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.040
Where is Robin?

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.350
You don't know either, Amon?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.440
I just got a call from Touko a while ago.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.350
Apparently, Robin didn't come home last night.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.720
A Salem Witch...

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:03.050
So, you finally figured it out.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.160
You're lying. That can't be true.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.730
A lie?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:16.840
The Salem Witches were executed 400 years ago...

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.140
So how could...

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:23.110
How could one of those Witches still be alive?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:29.660
The thing about time is that it doesn't always flow the same way.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:35.330
It can sometimes be like a deep, stagnant pool...

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.800
For certain people, that is.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.100
Don't you think she's just skipping work?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.510
She's not you. She wouldn't do something like that.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.280
Just as I thought, Robin isn't answering.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.440
The Master says she hasn't been to Harry's, either.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.480
Then she ran away.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.950
Like I said, she's not you!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.260
No offense, but if you've got all this time to shoot the breeze,

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.200
...maybe you could go out and find Robin.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:16.900
Even if that emblem didn't come from Robin, there has to be some connection.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.900
Sheesh, Michael is sure in a bad mood.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.370
Can you blame him?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.610
Somebody breached that little security system that he's so proud of.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.910
So what you're saying is, this message wasn't from her?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.350
Robin's terminal is merely a relay point.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:44.160
I believe that someone from the outside is using Robin's terminal...

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.070
...as a foothold to hack into the STN-J's system.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:53.830
Why? Just to send this Scarlet Letter to us like some kind of riddle?

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.770
We still don't know what the intruder's intentions are.

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.250
By the way, when did the intrusions start?

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.110
The first trace of an intrusion was a week ago.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.480
A week ago...

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.290
That means something?

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.730
That was the day we hunted Narumi, wasn't it?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:17.190
Yes, but Narumi ought to be in Factory custody.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:22.690
Yes, but what if other Witches were involved in that case?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:32.840
I hear that Narumi hadn't shown much in the way of powers until just recently.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:37.820
At the very least, he hadn't been flagged by the STN.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:44.180
Which leaves us with a Witch who channels someone else's powers, or a...

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.990
In any case, continue trying to pinpoint the intruder.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:53.930
I have some ideas along those Salem lines, so I'll do some checking of my own.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.260
You're getting involved personally, Administrator?

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:00.240
There's something about this that bothers me.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:06.700
You say that I am not real.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:11.780
However, can you say that you yourself are real?

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:17.150
You, who gives aid to the Confraria even though you are a Witch.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.490
No, l...

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:23.890
If you are not, how do you explain that power of yours?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.930
Are you saying that it isn't Witchcraft?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:33.910
In the end, are you, too, nothing but an offspring of Saturn?

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:37.680
Saturn?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.650
Go to the Walled City and wait, huh?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.590
What's the point?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:48.850
Is he saying that Robin's over there?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:53.720
Beats me. I'm sure Amon has something in mind, though.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.730
Anyway, let's get over there and stand by.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.640
Yeah, but my point is... Stand by for what?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:12.410
Do you know when the last Witch hunts were held?

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:17.080
England, 1717...

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:21.750
France, 1745...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:26.080
Germany, 1775...

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:31.300
And Poland, 1793.

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:37.400
How may innocents were put to death during those hunts?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:42.370
Some put the figure at several hundred thousand.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:48.640
No, there are even some who say that nine million Witches were burned.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.380
Nine million...!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:55.750
However, the tragedy did not end there.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:01.930
Those that envied the Witches' power continued their Witch hunt...

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:07.270
...by sinking into the darkest depths of society like pockets of water hidden underground.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:12.600
That's not true! We only hunt Witches whose hearts have turned to evil!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:16.870
For more than 300 years, I have been watching.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:22.580
And for more than 300 years, I have heard those same words.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.710
You still don't seem to believe me.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.250
very well.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:34.830
I will show you what your kind has been doing all this time.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.690
Your true guise.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.600
Our true guise...

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:47.210
In the name of the mages...

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.680
...I call on you, O Loki.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.270
Hey, what's the deal? What's going on here?!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.470
Michael!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:25.870
Dammit!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.810
How are they getting past my security?!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.150
Hi, Amon.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.280
What's wrong? My communicator isn't working.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:38.050
We can't use our terminal lines right now.

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:39.830
The terminals are down?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:43.060
It's that letter again! They hacked in about five minutes ago!

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.400
Most of the system is offline!

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:52.300
An attack on the STN-J?

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:11.160
This is the figure of a god, reverentially carved by man at the dawn of time.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.590
Do you understand, o maiden Witch?

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.370
The Devil?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.300
No, that's no god!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.240
That's... That's a...

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.000
Not a god?

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:35.310
So, you mean to say that it isn't a god, but rather the Devil?

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.250
But this IS a god.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.690
In its oldest form.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:46.190
The first that man knew.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:48.590
The first god.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:54.060
Amon, it looks like I'll be able to catch the person who's doing this.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.360
You figured out their point of entry?

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:58.400
Yeah, there was a hole.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:03.080
I think they're probably getting in through our comm system.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.380
What?!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.840
If you input the right access code, you can access the terminals directly.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.680
That's why the firewall didn't kick in.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.490
Have you found Robin's location?

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:18.030
I've been looking for a while now, but it looks like they've set up traps,

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.430
...so it's pretty tough to figure it out.

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.190
Try the Walled City.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.260
You have a lead?

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.100
I'll explain later. Put a rush on it.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.260
All right.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:35.300
Yes... Robin's scooter is here.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.010
Looks like she's here, all right.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.870
I see... I'll meet up with you.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.620
Don't go inside. Wait right there.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.880
Roger.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.180
The Devil!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:52.850
No! The Devil fell from Heaven because he let his desires consume him.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.860
That's why God...

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:58.830
How can you say for certain that it was the Devil who fell?

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:05.000
On the contrary, it was the one called "God"...

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:08.400
...who committed the atrocities that are recorded in history.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:13.010
He had to, to save humanity from their misguided ways...

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:15.210
For our salvation? That's not true.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:18.850
It wasn't out of such a simple sentiment.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:24.450
What really moved the gods to act was jealousy.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:29.800
Jealousy and terror towards their fellow gods who wield great power.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:33.720
Those two emotions spurred the gods onwards,

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:38.700
...leading them to annihilate those who were once their own kind.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:46.470
Yes, all the while calling those who shared their blood "fallen gods"...Witches.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.450
That can't be!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:54.280
Then, why did they take advantage of mankind's mistrust?

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.590
Why did they sow feelings of suspicion...

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:03.620
...and send completely innocent people to the stake?

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.800
I think you know why.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.470
I do?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:17.410
Because you, too, carry the blood of the countless people who died at the stake.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:23.850
That's right. You carry the same Witch's blood.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:29.590
Yes, sir. I believe the intruder lured Robin out,

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:35.790
...and used her terminal's personal code to hack into the STN-J's system.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.030
I see.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:41.800
I've been doing some digging on Salem since you left.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.770
Fairly accurate information about those events...

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.970
...is still extant in Witch circles.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:52.410
You've heard of the Methuselah Witch, I assume?

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.370
The immortal clan, you mean?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:56.220
That's right.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:59.450
They may actually exist.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.960
Knowledge that dates back a few centuries alone...

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.760
...can become a powerful weapon.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:07.700
A weapon?

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.560
Even if they don't have powers of their own,

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:14.990
...it's possible that they use their vast knowledge to control other Witches.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.570
What's wrong?

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:22.110
It's just that I remember Sakaki telling me...

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:26.980
...that Narumi suddenly lost his powers during that last hunt.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.710
Find Robin as quickly as possible.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.820
She may find the truth there.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.150
Understood.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:50.760
This is the final prayer of a girl who is about to be condemned to the stake.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.080
Those who hunt their own shadow...

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:15.550
...will be eventually destroyed by that same shadow.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.250
I've been...

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.030
...hunting my...

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:28.300
...own shadow?

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:34.310
The truth always has two faces.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.710
Amon?!

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:50.090
Witches must be hunted.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.170
No! I'm not a Witch!

00:17:59.870 --> 00:18:03.070
No? What makes you different?

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:06.810
My Craft is used to hunt Witches...

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:13.250
That is why you have burned Witches alive? In the flames of the stake?

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:17.120
No... That can't be true...

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:21.220
It's the same as it was 400 years ago.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.830
This history of suffering has yet to end.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.700
It continues even now.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.700
No, your people MAKE it continue.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.170
You carry the same Witches' blood...

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.810
Witches must be hunted.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.740
Amon...

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:45.890
Amon...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.490
Amon...

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.160
Amon!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:08.370
I can now put an end to it at last.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:19.150
So long... So very long...

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.390
400 years of knowledge...

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:55.150
All one needs to probe the arcana of the Craft...

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:57.660
What?

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.160
That's...

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:10.470
This is the Craft's...

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:23.910
Methuselah.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.680
A Witch given the task of living eternally.

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:30.650
The only thing that can bring death to its immortal soul...

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:35.830
...is a fire that will completely burn away its body.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.220
That's why she used me?

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:41.790
To put an end to eternity?

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:48.940
It may be that the act of burning Witches at the stake...

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:54.910
...is somehow tied in with distant memories of the Methuselah.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:03.120
Memories like that are too sad...

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:17.140
Hey.

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:19.430
Have you figured out what the Witch was after?

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.630
No sign of it at all.

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:27.110
It looks like she used the system just to get a message to Robin.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:28.510
To Robin?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:29.920
Yeah.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:33.980
Information about Robin's own powers, at that.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:37.950
Saturn, huh...?

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.720
What's that?

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.420
Greek mythology.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:46.460
He was obsessed with the thought that one of his children would overthrow him one day.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:51.300
As the myth goes, in the end, he killed his children and ate their flesh.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.400
His own children?

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:57.480
Those were apparently the Witch's last words to Robin.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.840
The Witch said that?

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:11.490
Recovered a relic that is possibly related to the secret of the Craft.

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:14.020
Standing by for further instructions.

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:44.730
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:47.590
Tell me.

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:59.580
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:09.470
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:13.960
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.330
...all those promises...

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:25.730
...inside me eventually...

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:31.530
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:40.310
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
